BT 72 720 Td 14 TL /F1 12 Tf (2 The AquaSol-9 Dataset and the MolAnchor Fingerprint) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (The AquaSol-9 dataset contains 14237 curated molecules with synthetic) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (solubility annotations in logS units, generated by a latent property model) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (that mixes fragment contributions with mild non-linear interactions. The) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (curation protocol removes salts, duplicates, and structures heavier than 900) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (daltons. Because the generating process is known, AquaSol-9 provides a) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (controlled testbed for representation choices.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (The MolAnchor fingerprint augments each atom with a learned anchor embedding) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (that summarizes its ring membership and hydrogen-bonding profile within two) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (hops. Unlike circular fingerprints with fixed radius, MolAnchor anchors are) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (trained jointly with the downstream network, so the effective radius adapts to) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (the property being predicted.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (3 Model Architecture) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (The MolAnchor-GNN stacks four message-passing layers with sum aggregation and) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (a jumping-knowledge readout. The depth of four layers was chosen deliberately:) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (prior survey evidence on controlled graph benchmarks indicates that message-) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (passing accuracy saturates quickly beyond twelve layers, so we keep the) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (architecture shallow and invest capacity in the fingerprint instead. A two-) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (layer MLP head predicts logS from the pooled graph representation.) Tj T* ET
endstream
